// docs/experiments/ — LEGACY RECORD AREA (F4 2026-10-29).
//
// This tree holds historical experiment specs and results. It is readable
// and tracked docs may still be edited for provenance, but it is NOT an
// approved home for NEW documents: the DOC-HOME write gate blocks new files
// here (see PART IV-C home_policy in classification_policy_plan.vsm).
//
// Where new work goes:
//   - an experiment with an active plan -> docs/plans/<plan>/<phase>/
//   - an unvalidated proposal           -> docs/design/sandbox/
//   - a dated result/record             -> docs/findings/ or docs/ledger/
//   - a design of an instrument         -> docs/design/sources/
//
// Historical files keep their original status; path + README are the
// authority. Promotion/archive happens in the F4 waves, not by ad-hoc moves.
⟦ /experiments_readme ⟧
